{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05170","headline":"自荆湖入朝至岳阳奉别张燕公 · 王琚","name":"自荆湖入朝至岳阳奉别张燕公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五载朝天子，三湘逢旧僚。\n扁舟方辍櫂，清论遂终朝。\n远树烟间没，长江地际遥。\n帝城驰梦想，归帆满风飙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王琚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}